&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced system-level debugging capability across hardware, RF, software, and firmware boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;B.S. or M.S. in Electrical, Electronic, Telecommunications, or Mechatronics Engineering (or equivalent experience).&lt;/p&gt;
