&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;STARK is a new kind of defence technology company revolutionizing the way autonomous systems are deployed across multiple domains. We design, develop, and manufacture high-performance unmanned systems that are software-defined, mass-scalable, and cost-effective. This provides our operators with a decisive edge in highly contested environments. We are focused on delivering deployable, high-performance systems, not future promises. In a time of rising threats, STARK is bolstering the technological edge of NATO Allies and their Partners to deter aggression and defend Europe today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You will be the core architect of our digital shop floor. Your main mission is the continuous operation, optimization, and, above all, the innovative further development of our Manufacturing Execution System (MES).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you bridge the gap between IT and the shop floor: you don&#39;t just see code and data,but you truly understand the physical manufacturing processes. By ensuring a seamless, end-to-end digital production flow, you create the foundation for real-time factory intelligence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MES Ownership &amp;amp; Evolution:&amp;nbsp;Maintain, optimize - and actively drive the further development of our MES environment to map, support, and improve our physical assembly and manufacturing workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process Digitalization:&amp;nbsp;Actively collaborate with production teams to translate complex physical manufacturing processes into smart, digital workflows within the MES.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systems Integration:&amp;nbsp;Connect the MES seamlessly with ERP and shop-floor automation layers to ensure full traceability, data continuity, and quality analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Production Intelligence:&amp;nbsp;Develop and maintain data pipelines to monitor key performance indicators such as OEE, throughput, yield, and downtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Visualization:&amp;nbsp;Build and manage intuitive dashboards to provide leadership and operations teams with actionable insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MES Ownership &amp;amp; Evolution:&amp;nbsp;Maintain, optimize - and actively drive the further development of our MES environment to map, support, and improve our physical assembly and manufacturing workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process Digitalization:&amp;nbsp;Actively collaborate with production teams to translate complex physical manufacturing processes into smart, digital workflows within the MES.&lt;/p&gt;
