&lt;li&gt;Scientific instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precision engineering environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FPGA-based hardware and embedded systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
