&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science engineering or similar field of study.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in a technical support capacity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience supporting enterprise products in a SaaS in a customer-facing role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with Public Clouds AWS/GCP/Azure and their services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with REST APIs and integration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with on-premise or cloud MDM solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
