&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Care Officer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in ensuring a smooth and reliable experience for both merchants and consumers using Alma.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support users, resolve complex requests and contribute to improving our operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, with &lt;strong&gt;2 days of remote work per week&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occasional weekend shifts may be required (approximately twice per quarter).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; merchant support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle complex requests from merchants and consumers via email and phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide users in the use of Alma’s payment solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and helpful responses while ensuring a high level of customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; process management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage debt collection actions and follow up on payment delays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth onboarding of new merchants and help them implement the Alma solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor cases and ensure issues are resolved efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring issues and share insights to improve processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to quality reviews and operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the onboarding and training of new team members as the team grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You would be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong written and verbal communication skills in &lt;strong&gt;French and English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;customer-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;, empathetic and solution-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;organized and rigorous&lt;/strong&gt; in your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;autonomous and resourceful&lt;/strong&gt; when solving problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-growing environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A first experience in &lt;strong&gt;customer support, operations or similar roles&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in &lt;strong&gt;Paris (10th arrondissement)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Lille – Euratechnologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance fully covered for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers (Swile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable mobility package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choice of laptop (Mac or Windows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular team events and internal talks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The process includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductory interview with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with the Team Lead or Operations Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team fit discussion with members of the Operation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place — serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience — without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR in 2025, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alma is a lender. We originate several million consumer receivables a year, carry them for a few weeks, and refinance them off a deliberately light balance sheet through securitization vehicles (Fonds Communs de Titrisation) and our other funding lines. We are regulated as a société de financement and a payment institution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That changes what &quot;accounting&quot; means here. A lender&#39;s accounts are not a monthly deliverable produced at the end of a chain: &lt;strong&gt;they are the chain&lt;/strong&gt;. Every payment event, every commission, every provision, every sale of receivables to an FCT has to become a journal entry that ties — to the transaction underneath it, to the general ledger above it, and to the prudential statements the regulator reads. At our scale and growth, this is a strategic topic, and one that is as much about data as it is about accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today the chain exists: an internal core banking ledger we built ourselves, feeding NetSuite, feeding regulatory reporting. What it does not have is a single owner who understands it end-to-end, holds it to the standard a regulated lender needs, and evolves it as the business changes (geographies, products, licenses). That is the role we are opening.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join an Accounting team inside a Finance organization of ~15 people covering Strategic Financing, FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Regulatory reporting and Controlling. You will report to the Head of Financing &amp;amp; Accounting, alongside the Financing team and the General Accounting Manager, who oversees corporate cycles, tax, statutory and consolidated accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with unusual ownership for its level: the banking accounting scope is yours from day one, and so is the data chain that produces it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the accounting of the credit business:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how the portfolio is represented in the books: origination, revenue recognition on merchant and customer commissions, deferred income, write-offs and recoveries, cost of risk and provisioning on performing and non-performing exposures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the accounting of our securitizations: sales of receivables to the FCTs, derecognition, discount and over-collateralisation, residual interests, servicing and management fees, hedging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the accounting of our funding: corporate debt, commercial paper, and the new funding instruments we add as the refinancing strategy evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the core banking ledger:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the functional owner of the engine that turns business events into accounting: which event, which account, which currency, which date, which counterparty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify and validate the accounting schemes for every new product, partner and geography, and work with Engineering and Data on the ledger&#39;s model, its feed into the ERP, and the fixes when something drifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the audit trail end-to-end — from a single €40 installment to a line in a prudential statement — and make it documented enough to be walked through by someone whose job is to challenge it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reinforce the control framework:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and automate the reconciliations that hold the whole thing together: ledger ↔ general ledger ↔ bank ↔ FCT reporting ↔ prudential statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shorten monthly close, incl. turning a manual, end-of-month, spreadsheet-based check into an automated, evidenced, repeatable control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Finance&#39;s counterpart to Internal Control and Periodic Control on everything accounting-data related.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own regulatory reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the production and the quality of our prudential and statistical reporting — solvency, large exposures, liquidity, and the statistical returns that go with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reconciliation tables that matter most: prudential statements to accounting balances, regulatory returns to the trial balance, own funds and RWA back to their audit trail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reporting tooling and its data feeds, and work with the Regulatory and Financing teams on the evolutions of the prudential framework and on the treatment of our securitizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have around 6-7 years of experience, ideally starting in audit of financial services — banks, consumer credit, asset management, securitization — in a Big 4 or a specialised practice, possibly with a first move in-house. You know how to build a number, prove it, and defend it line by line in front of people whose job is to challenge it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know banking accounting for real: French banking GAAP, the PCEC, cost of risk, revenue recognition on credit products. Or you know financial services accounting well enough that the banking layer is a matter of months, not years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actually enjoy controls at scale — reconciling large populations, hunting the anomaly, chasing the last twelve euros of a four-hundred-million balance until you know exactly where they went. If that sounds tedious rather than satisfying, this is not your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are autonomous and scrappy. On things to build, or on things that already exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English and French — our documentation and our regulator are French, part of our business and our team are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold, or are working towards, the DEC (or CPA, ACCA, equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have been exposed to securitization — FCTs, SPVs, waterfalls, deconsolidation — or to a regulated credit institution from the inside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are autonomous on data.&lt;/strong&gt; SQL is a daily tool, a data warehouse does not intimidate you, and your reflex in front of a five-million-row population is to query it, not to ask someone for a summary. This is the single most important line in this job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know NetSuite, BigQuery, dbt or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in a scaling fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🎯 Interview Process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with Thibaut Mercier, Head of Financing, Regulatory Capital Optimization &amp;amp; Accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with Stephanie Combe, CFO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;orange_heart&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;open_hands&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;👐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You will join Alma’s central Data team, which supports a wide range of business teams, including Finance, Product, Marketing, Risk, and Operations. The team is made up of six Data Analysts, including several experienced colleagues, and works at the intersection of Data Engineering, Data Analytics, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Reporting to &lt;a class=&quot;text-blue-600 hover:underline hover:text-blue-800&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/gilmarlard/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Gil Marlard&lt;/a&gt;, you will help strengthen the data foundations that support reporting, analytics, operational processes, and business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a permanent (CDI) role based in Paris, with a hybrid working model, we are also open to full remote in France.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;briefcase&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;💼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;As an Analytics Engineer, you will help strengthen the data foundations that support the whole organization. The central Data team serves a wide range of business teams, including Finance, Product, Marketing, Risk, and Operations. You will join a team of six Data Analysts, including several experienced colleagues, and work at the intersection of Data Engineering, Data Analytics, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You will transform raw data into trusted datasets that support reporting, analytics, operational processes, such as deciding which customer to call, and business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Our data foundations currently have different levels of maturity across business teams, and part of our ambition is to rebuild and standardize some of them. Your work will be particularly important in enabling more self-service and conversational analytics for our business teams, by making data easier to find, understand, trust, and use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;A key part of your role will be improving the lineage and governance of our tables, following a medallion-inspired approach with clear layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data modeling and data quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain reusable data models, macros, and semantic layers in dbt and BigQuery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Develop staging, intermediate, and mart models following clear data modeling principles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Implement data quality tests, freshness checks, and documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Improve the lineage, ownership, and discoverability of our most important tables&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Strengthen our semantic layer and ensure that metric definitions are consistent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Identify and remove duplicated, obsolete, or deprecated datasets and content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Optimize queries and models for reliability, performance, and cost&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Central Data Analytics Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Build reusable data assets that can be leveraged by Data Analysts across different business domains&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Lead enablement by mentoring analysts and training them on dbt, Looker, governance, and metric definitions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Partner on the data platform roadmap across GCP, BigQuery, Argo, dbt, and Looker&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Contribute to keeping our data stack clean, reliable, and easy to maintain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews and help define analytics engineering standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Discuss and validate data contracts with the rest of the Engineering team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Data Analysts, Data Engineers, and business stakeholders to deliver trusted and actionable data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;toolbox&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧰&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;dbt, BigQuery, Looker, GCP, Argo, Git, Claude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;jigsaw&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧩&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have at least 2 years of experience in Analytics Engineering, Data Engineering, Data Analytics, or a similar role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have practical experience with dbt, including models, tests, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have a good understanding of data modeling concepts such as facts, dimensions, keys, and relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have experience with Git and pull-request-based development, excellent communication skills, and the ability to collaborate with technical and business teams. You are fluent in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You are familiar with BigQuery, Looker, GCP, and Airflow or Argo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
